        "content": "Target fact: F:ml430-int-add-modeq-left-ee732b5b\n\nInvestigate it with the read tools, then summarize in at most 200 words.\nSuggested moves, in order, but use your judgement and stop when you have\nenough:\n  1. fact_get on the target -- read its formal statement and fragment.\n  2. fact_neighbourhood -- what it rests on and what it would free.\n  3. kernel_theorems on the prelude its fragment names -- the premises you\n     would actually have. Use a glob; an empty result for a glob means the\n     lookup FAILED, not that the prelude is empty.\n  4. frontier_select -- other eligible facts of the same shape.\n  5. operation_registry -- whether anything already targets it.\n\nReport: the goal's structural shape, which premises exist, and which other\neligible facts share the shape. Do not propose a plan yet.",
